src/main/java holds Pebble's main sources from Maven Central's io.pebbletemplates:pebble:4.1.1 sources
jar (pebble-4.1.1-sources.jar, SHA-1 699371e19483456ebd81e2083bb7b436d3ad412d). They are identical to
pebble/src/main/java at the v4.1.1 tag. The four classes that need optional dependencies the app does
not use are left out:

- io/pebbletemplates/pebble/loader/ServletLoader.java (javax.servlet)
- io/pebbletemplates/pebble/loader/Servlet5Loader.java (jakarta.servlet)
- io/pebbletemplates/pebble/cache/template/CaffeineTemplateCache.java (Caffeine)
- io/pebbletemplates/pebble/cache/tag/CaffeineTagCache.java (Caffeine)

Local changes: none.
